From 5cbbbc997475e32e0517abb73a9f21229e5a37be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: althafvly <althafvly@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:12:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SetupWizard: /e/OS pages and branding on a17

Squashed port of /e/OS's SetupWizard bringup branch (epic265-a17-bringup)
onto the current a17 SetupWizard, which upstream rewrote:
- /e/ welcome page (logo, wording), restore page wired to the /e/ backup app
- /e/ account, parental control and Find my device pages
- Headwind MDM QR provisioning (6 taps on the welcome page)
- /e/ palette in Theme.Setup, /e/ strings and translations
- theme and navigation pages skipped after a backup restore

Bringup authors: althafvly, Nishith Khanna, Mohammed Althaf T, Aayush Gupta,
Alexandre Roux D'Anzi, Frank PREEL, Headwind MDM, Oliver Scott, Romain Hunault,
SahilSonar, jacquargia, mayorow.

[a17: wizard script taken from the bringup branch; WelcomeActivity and
RestoreIntroActivity rebuilt on the a17 Kotlin structure with the /e/ behaviour
re-added; the lottie welcome animation is replaced by the /e/ logo;
onNavigateNext() -> onNextPressed(); the isSkipped() hook added once in the
base class. Dependencies: a17 already ships zxing-core, so the bundled
core-3.5.4.jar is dropped (duplicate classes); the QR payload is parsed with
the platform's org.json instead of three bundled jackson jars. Only the
Apache-2.0 zxing-android-embedded aar (QR scanner UI) is kept.]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0127aPbuxQvhzD8TVw5auGLR
